{"nodes": [{"id": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_t031", "label": "T031 \u2014 El corte exportable, reproducible por otro", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Esto es lo que recibe el Sistema Nacional de Planeaci\u00f3n (V16). El BI lo construye otro equipo (V20), as\u00ed que lo nuestro no es el tablero: es el corte y su credibilidad. El formato final del archivo es Q25 y se aplaza a prop\u00f3sito."}, {"id": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_corte_reproducible", "label": "Otro analista reproduce el total (TRA-01)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El corte lleva con qu\u00e9 se calcul\u00f3: filtros, fecha, zona horaria, versi\u00f3n de cat\u00e1logo y diccionario. I6: la exportaci\u00f3n cuenta sobre el universo de IDs congelado y no vuelve a consultar, para no ofrecer mapas y exportaciones con universos contradictorios. Un aporte aclarado despu\u00e9s del corte no cambia lo exportado."}, {"id": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_diccionario_de_datos", "label": "Diccionario de datos con advertencia por indicador", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada uno de los ocho indicadores trae su advertencia obligatoria; p. ej. aportes recibidos: \u00abno son personas ni votos\u00bb. Sin la advertencia el n\u00famero se lee como otra cosa."}, {"id": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_exportacion_sin_identidad", "label": "El corte no lleva relatos, contactos ni c\u00f3digos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SEG-01: no exponer identidad innecesaria. Un corte lleva conteos y c\u00f3digos territoriales, nunca relatos ni contactos ni c\u00f3digos de comprobante."}], "edges": [{"source": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_t031", "target": "plantillas_tarea_plantilla_tarea", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_t031", "target": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_corte_reproducible", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_diccionario_de_datos", "target": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_corte_reproducible", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_exportacion_sin_identidad", "target": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_t031", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "construccion_tareas_t031_el_corte_exportable_exportacion_sin_identidad", "target": "construccion_tareas_t032_permisos_de_servidor_permiso_de_servidor", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "construccion/tareas/T031-el-corte-exportable.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}]